completion.text:
The issue is that `wait-five-min` starts from `season-soup` at 3510s, but `shave-veg` (which also depends on `simmer-lentils` → `wash-leaves`) doesn't end until 3930s. Both are in the same track and overlap. The solution is to move `wait-five-min` to its own independent track so it doesn't consume the `prep` task and doesn't conflict with the salad prep work happening in parallel.

